# Mobile invitation UI

Guests open invitations on phones. After any change to layout, skins, ornaments, photos, or hero copy, check **every affected guest URL** at **390×844** and **375×667**.

Look for:

- Decor, etchings, silk, grain, ken-burns, seals, or photos sitting on names, tagline, date, or the RSVP CTA
- Low contrast text on a busy background
- Cropped buttons or type that runs into the screen edge

A desktop screenshot is not verification. If an overlay shows up, fix it in the same slice.
